{"sections":[{"slug":"几何表示论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"几何表示论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">几何表示论</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“几何表示论”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#<span lang=\"zh\">几何表示论</span></p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">基础知识</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴O","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> O"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">的不可约对象为</span> $L_\\lambda\\,(\\lambda \\in\\mathfrak h^*)$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">块理论</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴O","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> O"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">被</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}Z(\\mathfrak g)$ <span lang=\"zh\">划分许多</span> “"},{"Local":{"url":"/块","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">块</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> O)"}},{"Plain":"” (blocks):\n$$\r\n\\mathcal O\\simeq \\bigoplus_{\\chi\\colon Z(\\mathfrak g)\\to\\mathbb{C}} \\mathcal O_{\\chi}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">对任意对象</span> $M\\in\\mathcal O$, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathbb{C}}(Z(\\mathfrak g)/\\operatorname{Ann}M)&lt;+\\infty$, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $\\operatorname{supp}M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是有限个离散点</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Verma模","text":"Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":" $M_\\lambda$, $\\operatorname{Ann}M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">是极大理想</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $Z(\\mathfrak g)$ <span lang=\"zh\">以某个特征</span> $\\chi\\colon Z(\\mathfrak g)\\to\\mathbb{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用于</span> $M_\\lambda$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}